---
description: Responsive, accessible, high-performance, video, SEO, testing, and GitHub Pages requirements for the Miruhaia LP
globs: "src/**/*, public/**/*, index.html, vite.config.*, .github/workflows/*, package.json"
alwaysApply: false
---

- Follow `@docs/RESPONSIVE_TECH_SPEC.md` and `@docs/LATEST_LP_PATTERNS_2026.md`.
- Use one responsive URL and keep primary content equivalent on desktop and mobile.
- Test 1440, 1024, 768, 390, 375, and 320 px with no horizontal page overflow.
- Use semantic HTML, visible focus, 44 px touch targets, meaningful alt text, keyboard controls, and reduced-motion support.
- Reserve media dimensions to prevent CLS. Prioritize only the LCP image and avoid loading all videos initially.
- Video uses controls, playsinline, poster, preload metadata, stable aspect ratio, no autoplay audio, and permission metadata.
- Target LCP <= 2.5 s, INP <= 200 ms, CLS <= 0.1 at the 75th percentile.
- Run lint, type check, tests, production build, internal-link/asset checks, and a real browser visual pass.
- For Vite project Pages, set the repository-aware base path and use a GitHub Actions deployment workflow.
